# Local, regenerable retrieval snapshot for run_eval.py's replay mode --
# see resolution_finder/eval_cache.py's own docstring. Not a versioned
# historical record the way data/eval_history.jsonl is; can be large
# (full article text per candidate, per market) and is trivially
# regenerated with `python run_eval.py --live`.
data/eval_cache.json

# Local diagnostic and calibration scripts. Deliberately untracked --
# these are one-off probes written to answer a specific question during
# a session (NLI score dumps, retrieval traces, coverage measurements),
# not maintained code. Their findings belong in commit messages, code
# comments and the plan docs; the scripts themselves are disposable.
scratchpad/
